{"seq":3,"slug":"analyser-visualization","title":"分析与可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/nodes/analyser-visualization","wordCount":1144,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"分析与可视化\">分析与可视化</h1><p>跳动的频谱柱、随音乐起伏的波形线、能识别节拍的可视化——这些「看得见的声音」背后都是同一个节点：AnalyserNode。它在图里很特别：所有其它处理节点都改变声音，唯独它什么都不改，只是站在信号旁边，每一刻把当前的波形和频谱抄一份给你。它是音频世界和图形世界之间唯一的官方接口——音频负责产出数据，怎么把数据变成像素是 Canvas 的事。理解它，你就能把任何声音「画出来」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AnalyserNode 提供两种视角看同一段声音：<strong>时域</strong>（波形——振幅随时间的起伏，回答「现在响不响、波形长啥样」）和<strong>频域</strong>（频谱——各频率成分的强弱，回答「这声音里有多少低音、多少高音」）。从时域到频域的桥梁是快速傅里叶变换（FFT）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  SRC[&quot;上游信号&quot;] --&gt; AN[&quot;AnalyserNode&lt;br/&gt;(旁路·不改变声音)&quot;]&#10;  AN --&gt; DOWN[&quot;继续连下游&lt;br/&gt;(声音照常播放)&quot;]&#10;  AN --&gt;|getByteTimeDomainData| TD[&quot;时域数据&lt;br/&gt;波形 Uint8Array&quot;]&#10;  AN --&gt;|getByteFrequencyData| FD[&quot;频域数据&lt;br/&gt;频谱 Uint8Array (FFT)&quot;]&#10;  TD --&gt; CV[&quot;Canvas 逐帧绘制&quot;]&#10;  FD --&gt; CV&#10;  CV --&gt; SCR[&quot;屏幕上跳动的可视化&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  SRC[\"上游信号\"] --&gt; AN[\"AnalyserNode&lt;br/&gt;(旁路·不改变声音)\"]\n  AN --&gt; DOWN[\"继续连下游&lt;br/&gt;(声音照常播放)\"]\n  AN --&gt;|getByteTimeDomainData| TD[\"时域数据&lt;br/&gt;波形 Uint8Array\"]\n  AN --&gt;|getByteFrequencyData| FD[\"频域数据&lt;br/&gt;频谱 Uint8Array (FFT)\"]\n  TD --&gt; CV[\"Canvas 逐帧绘制\"]\n  FD --&gt; CV\n  CV --&gt; SCR[\"屏幕上跳动的可视化\"]</pre><p>它的核心配置是 <code>fftSize</code>——必须是 2 的幂（典型 2048）。这个值串起两类输出的长度，下表是关键关系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>与 fftSize 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>fftSize</code></td>\n<td>FFT 窗口大小</td>\n<td>你设的，2 的幂，如 2048</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>frequencyBinCount</code></td>\n<td>频谱数据点数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext>fftSize</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\text{fftSize} / 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fftSize</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时域数据长度</td>\n<td>波形点数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext>fftSize</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\text{fftSize}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fftSize</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频率分辨率</td>\n<td>每个频谱桶代表多少 Hz</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>fftSize</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= f_s / \\text{fftSize}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fftSize</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>smoothingTimeConstant</code></td>\n<td>帧间平滑(0–1)</td>\n<td>越大频谱越「黏」越稳</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>frequencyBinCount 是 fftSize 的一半，这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/sampling-buffers\">采样与缓冲</a> 里讲的「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 点 FFT 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 个频率桶」。在 48000 Hz、fftSize=2048 下，每个桶约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2048</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>23.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48000/2048 \\approx 23.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48000/2048</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23.4</span></span></span></span></span> Hz——这就是你频谱的频率精度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时域-画波形\">时域：画波形</h2><p>最简单的可视化是示波器式波形。<code>getByteTimeDomainData</code> 把当前一窗的波形填进一个 <code>Uint8Array</code>，每个值 0–255，128 代表静音（中线），偏离中线就是振幅：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const analyser = ctx.createAnalyser();&#10;analyser.fftSize = 2048;&#10;source.connect(analyser);&#10;analyser.connect(ctx.destination); // 旁路: 声音继续播&#10;&#10;const buf = new Uint8Array(analyser.fftSize);&#10;const cvCtx = canvas.getContext(&#39;2d&#39;);&#10;&#10;function drawWave() {&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(drawWave); // 跟着屏幕刷新率取数据&#10;  analyser.getByteTimeDomainData(buf); // 填入当前波形&#10;  cvCtx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);&#10;  cvCtx.beginPath();&#10;  const step = canvas.width / buf.length;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; buf.length; i++) {&#10;    const y = ((buf[i] / 128) * canvas.height) / 2; // 128=中线&#10;    i === 0 ? cvCtx.moveTo(0, y) : cvCtx.lineTo(i * step, y);&#10;  }&#10;  cvCtx.stroke();&#10;}&#10;drawWave();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const analyser = ctx.createAnalyser();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>analyser.fftSize = 2048;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>source.connect(analyser);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>analyser.connect(ctx.destination); // 旁路: 声音继续播</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const buf = new Uint8Array(analyser.fftSize);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const cvCtx = canvas.getContext('2d');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function drawWave() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  requestAnimationFrame(drawWave); // 跟着屏幕刷新率取数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  analyser.getByteTimeDomainData(buf); // 填入当前波形</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cvCtx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cvCtx.beginPath();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const step = canvas.width / buf.length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (let i = 0; i &#x3C; buf.length; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const y = ((buf[i] / 128) * canvas.height) / 2; // 128=中线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    i === 0 ? cvCtx.moveTo(0, y) : cvCtx.lineTo(i * step, y);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cvCtx.stroke();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>drawWave();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键节奏：<strong>取数据用 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code></strong>，让可视化跟着屏幕刷新（通常 60fps）走，而不是音频线程的速率。音频线程每 2.67ms 推进一个量子，但你眼睛看不了那么快，每 16ms 抄一份当前快照足够。绘制本身（路径、像素）的全部技巧属于 Canvas（见 <a href=\"../../canvas-2d-graphics/interaction/animation-loop\">Canvas · 动画循环</a>），本节只负责把数据正确取出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"频域-画频谱\">频域：画频谱</h2><p>更常见的是频谱柱状图——把声音拆成低到高的频率条。<code>getByteFrequencyData</code> 填入 <code>frequencyBinCount</code> 个值（0–255 表示每个频率桶的强度，已转成 dB 再规约）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const bins = new Uint8Array(analyser.frequencyBinCount); // fftSize/2&#10;function drawSpectrum() {&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(drawSpectrum);&#10;  analyser.getByteFrequencyData(bins);&#10;  cvCtx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);&#10;  const barW = canvas.width / bins.length;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; bins.length; i++) {&#10;    const h = (bins[i] / 255) * canvas.height; // 桶强度 → 柱高&#10;    cvCtx.fillRect(i * barW, canvas.height - h, barW - 1, h);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const bins = new Uint8Array(analyser.frequencyBinCount); // fftSize/2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function drawSpectrum() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  requestAnimationFrame(drawSpectrum);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  analyser.getByteFrequencyData(bins);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cvCtx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const barW = canvas.width / bins.length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (let i = 0; i &#x3C; bins.length; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const h = (bins[i] / 255) * canvas.height; // 桶强度 → 柱高</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    cvCtx.fillRect(i * barW, canvas.height - h, barW - 1, h);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个实用细节。其一，<strong>频率轴是线性但听感是对数</strong>：bins 在频率上等距分布，但人耳对频率的感知接近对数，所以低频挤在左边一小撮、高频铺满右边大半。要好看常按对数重新分桶，或只取前 1/4（语音、音乐能量主要在低中频）。其二，<code>smoothingTimeConstant</code>（默认 0.8）决定频谱跳动的「黏度」——它在帧间做指数平滑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>τ</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_t = \\tau X_{t-1} + (1-\\tau)|FFT_t|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，调高更稳重、调低更灵敏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不止于画-节拍与电平检测\">不止于画：节拍与电平检测</h2><p>AnalyserNode 的数据不只能画，还能驱动逻辑。两个高频用途：</p>\n<p><strong>音量电平（VU 表 / 静音检测）</strong>——对时域数据算均方根（RMS）就得到瞬时响度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RMS</mtext><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RMS} = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=0}^{N-1} x_i^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RMS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3338em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0561em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5.2938em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1.056em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.0161em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2938em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.742em;height:3.3738em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.3738em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3373\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M702 80H40000040\nH742v3239l-4 4-4 4c-.667.7 -2 1.5-4 2.5s-4.167 1.833-6.5 2.5-5.5 1-9.5 1\nh-12l-28-84c-16.667-52-96.667 -294.333-240-727l-212 -643 -85 170\nc-4-3.333-8.333-7.667-13 -13l-13-13l77-155 77-156c66 199.333 139 419.667\n219 661 l218 661zM702 80H400000v40H742z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"function getRMS() {&#10;  analyser.getByteTimeDomainData(buf);&#10;  let sum = 0;&#10;  for (const v of buf) {&#10;    const x = (v - 128) / 128;&#10;    sum += x * x;&#10;  }&#10;  return Math.sqrt(sum / buf.length); // 0~1，可驱动音量条/判静音&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function getRMS() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  analyser.getByteTimeDomainData(buf);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let sum = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (const v of buf) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const x = (v - 128) / 128;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sum += x * x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return Math.sqrt(sum / buf.length); // 0~1，可驱动音量条/判静音</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这正是上一节 <a href=\"gain-filter-nodes\">增益与滤波节点</a> 里近似侧链压缩需要的电平信号——检测人声 RMS 去踩低音乐 gain。</p>\n<p><strong>节拍/能量检测</strong>——盯住低频桶（鼓点能量集中处）的瞬时能量，超过近段历史均值一定倍数就判为一个 beat。这是音乐可视化、游戏节奏判定、灯光同步的基础（见 <a href=\"../practice/web-audio-in-games\">游戏与音乐应用</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  AN[&quot;AnalyserNode&quot;] --&gt; A[&quot;画频谱/波形&lt;br/&gt;(可视化)&quot;]&#10;  AN --&gt; B[&quot;算 RMS&lt;br/&gt;(电平/静音/侧链)&quot;]&#10;  AN --&gt; C[&quot;低频能量峰值&lt;br/&gt;(节拍检测)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; USE1[&quot;驱动音量条·近似侧链&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; USE2[&quot;音乐同步·节奏游戏&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  AN[\"AnalyserNode\"] --&gt; A[\"画频谱/波形&lt;br/&gt;(可视化)\"]\n  AN --&gt; B[\"算 RMS&lt;br/&gt;(电平/静音/侧链)\"]\n  AN --&gt; C[\"低频能量峰值&lt;br/&gt;(节拍检测)\"]\n  B --&gt; USE1[\"驱动音量条·近似侧链\"]\n  C --&gt; USE2[\"音乐同步·节奏游戏\"]</pre><p>一个性能提醒：AnalyserNode 取数据本身很轻，但每帧的 Canvas 绘制可能成为瓶颈。重型可视化应考虑把绘制放进 OffscreenCanvas + Worker，详见 <a href=\"../practice/audio-performance\">音频性能与延迟</a> 和 <a href=\"../../canvas-2d-graphics/advanced/offscreen-workers\">Canvas · 离屏与 Worker</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>AnalyserNode 是唯一不改变声音的处理节点，它在旁路上抄出波形与频谱，是音频与图形的官方接口。</li>\n<li>两种视角：时域看波形（<code>getByteTimeDomainData</code>，128 为中线）、频域看频谱（<code>getByteFrequencyData</code>，FFT 产出 <code>fftSize/2</code> 个桶，桶宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>fftSize</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s/\\text{fftSize}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fftSize</span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>取数据用 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 跟屏幕刷新走，绘制技巧归 Canvas；<code>smoothingTimeConstant</code> 调频谱跳动黏度。</li>\n<li>频率轴等距但听感对数，常按对数重分桶；数据还能算 RMS 做电平/侧链、盯低频做节拍检测。</li>\n<li>取数据轻、Canvas 绘制重——重型可视化考虑 OffscreenCanvas + Worker。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>数据来源的滤波/增益处理：<a href=\"gain-filter-nodes\">增益与滤波节点</a></li>\n<li>FFT 桶宽与采样率的关系出处：<a href=\"../foundations/sampling-buffers\">采样与缓冲</a></li>\n<li>节拍检测在音乐场景的落地：<a href=\"../practice/web-audio-in-games\">游戏与音乐应用</a></li>\n<li>跨库：把频谱数据画成像素，见 <a href=\"../../canvas-2d-graphics/interaction/animation-loop\">Canvas · 动画循环</a></li>\n<li>跨库：绘制卸载到离屏 Worker，见 <a href=\"../../canvas-2d-graphics/advanced/offscreen-workers\">Canvas · 离屏与 Worker</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分析与可视化","id":"分析与可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"时域：画波形","id":"时域-画波形"},{"level":2,"text":"频域：画频谱","id":"频域-画频谱"},{"level":2,"text":"不止于画：节拍与电平检测","id":"不止于画-节拍与电平检测"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"增益与滤波节点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/nodes/gain-filter-nodes"},"next":{"title":"振荡器合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/synthesis/oscillator-synthesis"}}